"""One-line descriptions for the TRWConfig fields whose declaration carries none (`trw-mcp config-reference`).

The declarations in ``_fields_*.py`` are plain annotated attributes; the text lives here so a domain mixin file does not
grow past its line ceiling. ``apply_descriptions`` copies each entry onto the field's ``description`` when
``_main_fields`` assembles the config class and to ``TRWConfig`` itself, so ``model_fields`` and the reference see it (the
cached JSON schema is not rebuilt for it).
``tests/test_config_field_descriptions.py`` fails when a field has no description in either place.
"""

